SCOPE — READ THIS FIRST

This licence covers the code and documentation in this repository: build-payload.sh,
README.md, ATTRIBUTIONS.md, manifest.json and the repository configuration, together with
the decision model expressed in payload/data_0_tables/ (FC.csv, ATTR.csv, MG.csv), which
was authored for the Innertkirchen–Mettlen case study.

IT DOES NOT COVER THE GEODATA UNDER payload/. Those files are third-party Swiss open
government data, redistributed here under their publishers' own terms, which are not this
licence and cannot be granted by the copyright holders above. Each dataset, its publisher
and its terms are listed in ATTRIBUTIONS.md. In summary: all are "open use", commercial use
is permitted, none is copyleft, and several require the source to be cited on reuse — an
obligation imposed by the publishing federal office, which nobody here is able to waive.

